sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant B as Blazor Server
    participant Coord as Parallel Task Coordinator
    participant G1 as Gemini Slot 1
    participant G2 as Gemini Slot 2
    participant GN as Gemini Slots 3-10
    participant TS as Table Storage

    Note over U,TS: Bulk Generate — parallel multi-slot image generation

    U->>B: Submit prompt with art style count (up to 10)
    B->>TS: INSERT BulkPrompt (PromptId=GUID, Status=Pending)
    B->>TS: UPDATE BulkPrompt (Status=Processing)
    B->>Coord: Dispatch Task.WhenAll (10 parallel slots)

    Note over Coord,GN: Concurrent generation — no ordering guarantee

    par Slot 1 — Watercolor
        Coord->>G1: GenerateImageAsync("Watercolor style: {prompt}")
        G1-->>Coord: PNG bytes [index=0, ~3-8s]
        Coord->>TS: INSERT ImageResult [index=0]
        Coord->>B: StateHasChanged() → render slot 1
        B-->>U: Slot 1 image appears live
    and Slot 2 — Oil Painting
        Coord->>G2: GenerateImageAsync("Oil painting: {prompt}")
        G2-->>Coord: PNG bytes [index=1, ~3-8s]
        Coord->>TS: INSERT ImageResult [index=1]
        Coord->>B: StateHasChanged() → render slot 2
        B-->>U: Slot 2 image appears live
    and Slots 3-10 — remaining art styles
        Coord->>GN: GenerateImageAsync(styles 3-10 concurrently)
        GN-->>Coord: PNG bytes [index=2..9, variable timing]
        Coord->>TS: INSERT ImageResult [index=2..9]
        Coord->>B: StateHasChanged() batch updates
        B-->>U: Slots 3-10 appear as ready
    end

    Note over B,TS: Rate Limiter enforces Fixed Window per client on /api routes

    Coord->>B: All slots complete
    B->>TS: UPDATE BulkPrompt (Status=Complete)
    B-->>U: Full grid of 10 images rendered
    Note over U: Conflict resolution: last-write-wins per index slot in Table Storage
